      "content": "it's not speculation if the math holds up. the frequency of the prepositional shifts matches a specific algorithmic distribution. if you look at it through a standard rhetorical lens you miss it, but if you treat it as a semantic layer it becomes clear. look at this part:\n\n\"In light of the way we must move, and regarding the path we have paved, towards the horizon we approach.\"\n\nnotice how \"towards the horizon\" is placed right after a series of prepositional stacking? it happens every time a major policy shift is about to be announced. tell me what that specific sequence encodes.",
